# CI / Hooks

## Pre-commit (Husky)

`.husky/pre-commit` → `.config/bash/hook-checks.sh` (parity with GHA health + bash):

1. `pnpm btest` — bash suite (`bash.yaml`)
2. `pnpm check` — Biome
3. `pnpm typeslint` — `tsc` for `@nucleify/web`
4. `pnpm slint` — Stylelint
5. `pnpm build` — Nuxt production build (`health-check` build job)
6. `pnpm tests` — Vitest

Compiler unit / convert / emit checks live in the private `nucleify-compiler` repo (and optional local `pnpm compiler:*` when the submodule is checked out). They are not part of public CI or pre-commit.

## Pre-push

`.husky/pre-push` is a no-op (`exit 0`). Do not re-run the suite here.

## GitHub Actions

### `health-check.yml` (all branches)

Node 22, pnpm. Parallel jobs after setup: biome, typeslint, stylelint, build, test.

### `bash.yaml`

Runs `bash .config/bash/tests/run.sh` on push (no submodule checkout).
